{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Knot.FigureEightDeformedMeridianWinding","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightDeformedMeridianWinding","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Complex.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Trigonometric.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.DeformedMeridianWinding.meridian_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.DeformedMeridianWinding.meridian_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightDeformedMeridianWinding.lean#L76-L83","doc":"Consequently the datum can never equal `0` for `k ≥ 1`: the winding always\nkeeps the deformation nonzero (there is no substrate winding datum at the\ncomplete structure `u = 0`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.DeformedMeridianWinding.meridian_normSq_ge_floor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.DeformedMeridianWinding.meridian_normSq_ge_floor","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightDeformedMeridianWinding.lean#L65-L74","doc":"**The datum is never in the small-|u| disk.** For every winding `k ≥ 1`,\n`|u|² ≥ (2π)²` — the substrate winding datum sits OUTSIDE any disk\n`|u| < 2π`, in particular outside Murakami's controlled small-|u|\nneighborhood of the geometric structure. Algebraic core of the branch-B3\nscope-(a) obstruction to an anchor-free q₀. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.DeformedMeridianWinding.meridian_normSq_ge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.DeformedMeridianWinding.meridian_normSq_ge","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightDeformedMeridianWinding.lean#L56-L63","doc":"**Winding lower bound (squared-modulus form).** `|u|² ≥ (2πk)²`: the\nimaginary winding part alone forces it, independent of the real offset\n`a = N·t`. Since `normSq = |u|²` this is exactly `|u| ≥ 2πk`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.DeformedMeridianWinding.meridian_normSq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.DeformedMeridianWinding.meridian_normSq","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightDeformedMeridianWinding.lean#L50-L54","doc":"`|u|² = a² + (2πk)²`, the squared modulus of the substrate-matched meridian. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.DeformedMeridianWinding.meridian_im","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.DeformedMeridianWinding.meridian_im","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightDeformedMeridianWinding.lean#L47-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.DeformedMeridianWinding.meridian_re","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.DeformedMeridianWinding.meridian_re","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightDeformedMeridianWinding.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.DeformedMeridianWinding.meridian","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.DeformedMeridianWinding.meridian","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/FigureEightDeformedMeridianWinding.lean#L41-L43","doc":"The substrate-matched Murakami meridian datum for 4₁:\n`u = a − 2πi·k` with `a = N·t` (real) and winding `k`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}